{"title":"2007 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems\">2007 AMC 12B #11</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Problems\">2007 AMC 10B #15</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The angles of quadrilateral <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> satisfy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/e/96eccef7588e23271a0d263c87e3cc997c726c06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A=2 \\angle B=3 \\angle C=4 \\angle D.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"213\" height=\"13\" /> What is the degree measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/a/78ac988be3830a77b0fa5078a20f28a509eb0939.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle A,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"30\" height=\"16\" /> rounded to the nearest whole number?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/2/812d49d03e5f27d38366c60334433e4d4119883e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 125 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 144 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 153 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 173 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 180$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"443\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of the interior angles of any quadrilateral is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/b/5cb6d9aa13776acda22b9a6d94e65077438a4625.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$360^\\circ.$\" width=\"38\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/b/beb6f3e3ca45085449c65f3480bc70219a99345c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 360 &amp;= \\angle A + \\angle B + \\angle C + \\angle D\\\\ &amp;= \\angle A + \\frac{1}{2}A + \\frac{1}{3}A + \\frac{1}{4}A\\\\ &amp;= \\frac{12}{12}A + \\frac{6}{12}A + \\frac{4}{12}A + \\frac{3}{12}A\\\\ &amp;= \\frac{25}{12}A \\end{align*}\" width=\"261\" height=\"149\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/8/288a357b357408d940cbe49d2de74f1f15a2fc78.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\angle A = 360 \\cdot \\frac{12}{25} = 172.8 \\approx \\boxed{\\mathrm{(D) \\ } 173}\\]\" width=\"275\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B\">2007 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">Problem 12</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href